{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================
  snippets/ak-notebook-mystery-box.liquid
  MYSTERY BOX — NOTEBOOK CONVERSION (Stage MB-1, paper + ink shell only)
  (experiment theme 186464731416 only — DO NOT PUBLISH)

  The NINTH notebook surface (after Products, Life/Style, Club Hub,
  Narrative, Bad Music /pages/2025, Bad Music /pages/badmusic-2025,
  Archive /collections, Cart /cart). Converts /pages/mystery-box
  (templates/page.mystery-box.json) to the notebook-paper system using
  the accepted "dark object ON the paper" direction — the bunker-monitor
  iframe shell stays a DARK device laid on the yellow legal-pad paper
  (the Life/Style / Bad Music / Archive precedent, NOT a reskin of the
  Mystery Crate iframe). Paper backdrop + ink nav + Due Date footer CTA.
  NO doodles (Stage MB-1).

  - Rendered from ONE NEW custom-liquid host section added to
    templates/page.mystery-box.json (there was NO spare/disabled slot to
    repurpose — its only custom-liquid section, custom_liquid_mysterybox_embed,
    is the LIVE Vercel iframe embed and must stay byte-identical). The host
    (custom_liquid_mbhost) is placed in `order` right AFTER ak-top and BEFORE
    custom_liquid_mysterybox_embed so the class + paper render EARLY -> no flash
    of the dark #000 wrapper. It is guarded by a LIQUID ROUTE GUARD in the
    template: {% raw %}{% if page.handle == 'mystery-box' %}{% endraw %} (the page-route house guard).
  - Adds .ak-mysterybox-page to <html> via the standard one-line classList
    hook (the established pattern; the ONLY JS here).
  - Paints the accepted legal-pad paper scoped to .ak-mysterybox-page.

  THE ONE ROUTE-SPECIFIC PAINT — the heart of "paper around the dark monitor":
    .ak-mysterybox-page #ak-mysterybox-embed.ak-mb-wrap{ background:transparent !important; }
  The embed wrapper paints its own full-bleed background:#000 in a <style>
  block inside custom_liquid_mysterybox_embed (ordinary stylesheet specificity
  1,1,0 — NOT an inline attribute, so it is beatable). The override (1,2,0)
  strips ONLY that #000 fill so the body paper shows in the gutters around the
  centered monitor. It changes `background` ONLY — width:100vw /
  margin-left:calc(50% - 50vw) / min-height:100vh / padding / box-sizing /
  overflow:hidden AND the JS-set inline embed.style.height are ALL untouched,
  so the embed's getBoundingClientRect-driven sizing/canvas math is byte-stable.

  PRESERVED BYTE-IDENTICAL / UNTOUCHED (no selector here targets them):
  - custom_liquid_mysterybox_embed: iframe markup, iframe src, query params,
    customer_id handoff ({{ customer.id }} + ?customer_id fallback), demo=1
    passthrough, LOCKED_DEFAULT, sizeLayout()/embed.style.height, the canvas
    IIFE + its combined guard, embed.dataset.akMbInit.
  - .ak-mb-frame (the dark #111->#0a0a0a bunker monitor — the "dark object",
    left dark on purpose), .ak-mb-iframe, .ak-mb-stage, .ak-mb-lock(+card/glint),
    the z-index ladder (shell-fx 3 / prestart 4 / lock 5 / bevel+LED 6).
  - .ak-mb-canvas: already CSS-hidden by the embed itself
    (#ak-mysterybox-embed .ak-mb-canvas{display:none!important}); its rAF JS
    keeps running harmlessly. This snippet does NOT touch it (re-enabling or
    JS-disabling it would break the shared iframe/customer_id IIFE).
  - sections/ak-mb-prestart.liquid (the START/ACCESS gate + persistent shell-fx)
    and sections/ak-mb-release.liquid (the dormant midnight-PT countdown into
    #akMbLock) — both byte-identical; their section wrappers are cleared by the
    shared .shopify-section backstop but their inner dark panels stay dark.
  - sections/ak-top.liquid, sections/ak-footer.liquid, layout/theme.liquid,
    sections/main-product.liquid, the combo product / page / _preview_hat_id,
    the Vercel app, the Mystery Crate repo, all other pages, cart, products,
    archive, checkout, the live theme, the normal dev theme.

  NAV: ported mask-PNG ink nav + ink header/cart re-scoped to .ak-mysterybox-page
  (ak-top.liquid NOT edited). CANDYFACTS (.ak-top-candy, href /pages/mystery-box)
  is the .is-active tile on this route. It is an IMAGE tile (candyfacts.png), NOT
  a masked wordmark, so its active treatment is the base ak-top
  `.ak-top-candy.is-active .ak-top-candy-img{ filter: magenta glow }` (left
  intact — the snippet's filter:none is on the .ak-top-candy TILE, not the
  -img), i.e. the candy graphic with the accepted #ff33ff drop-shadow glow.
  The shared .ak-top-tile.is-active::before purple+glow cue is ported for the
  masked wordmark tiles (parity with Archive/Narrative) but is inert on candy.

  FOOTER: ak-footer is in this template's order, so the Due Date back-to-top CTA
  is ported (reusing assets/ak-due-date.woff2; no '#' -> no Tenada).
  ak-footer.liquid is NOT edited.

  HARD HAZARD — never add width / max-width / height / min-height / overflow /
  position / display constraints to #ak-mysterybox-embed.ak-mb-wrap or any
  child (.ak-mb-frame / .ak-mb-iframe / .ak-mb-lock / .ak-mb-canvas), and never
  touch the embed/prestart/release JS: the embed sizes the iframe + canvas from
  getBoundingClientRect and sets embed.style.height inline. ONLY `background`
  (paint) is touched on the wrapper here. No doodles in Stage MB-1.

  Revert (whole Mystery Box notebook host): in templates/page.mystery-box.json
  delete the custom_liquid_mbhost section + its entry in `order` (restores the
  order main / ak-top / custom_liquid_mysterybox_embed / ak-mb-prestart /
  ak-mb-release / ak-footer), and delete this snippet. (Or git revert the
  "experiment: add mystery box notebook shell" commit.)
  custom_liquid_mysterybox_embed / ak-mb-prestart / ak-mb-release never change
  either way.
  ============================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

<script>
  /* Page hook — this snippet only renders behind the
     page.handle == 'mystery-box' Liquid guard in
     templates/page.mystery-box.json, so the class can be added
     unconditionally. */
  (function(){ document.documentElement.classList.add('ak-mysterybox-page'); })();
</script>

<style>
  /* ============================================================
     STAGE MB-1 — MYSTERY BOX NOTEBOOK SHELL
     CSS-only, scoped to .ak-mysterybox-page. Paper + ink shell only;
     NO doodles, NO iframe/prestart/release/canvas/monitor edits.
     ============================================================ */

  /* ---- Notebook paper backdrop. Same accepted values as the other
     notebook pages (shared --ak-paper-side-gap). html.ak-mysterybox-page
     specificity is LOAD-BEARING: it must beat the global
     html,body{background:#000 !important} net in layout/theme.liquid. ---- */
  html.ak-mysterybox-page{
    --ak-paper-top-gap: clamp(150px, 17vw, 220px);    /* blank top band behind the KID logo / nav */
    --ak-paper-bottom-gap: clamp(130px, 12vw, 190px); /* blank bottom band — ruled lines fade out so the page doesn't end mid-line */
    --ak-purple:#ff33ff;                              /* official AmeriKid purple */
    background:#f5dd4f !important;                    /* overscroll/canvas fallback — beats the global html #000 via specificity */
  }
  html.ak-mysterybox-page body{
    --ak-paper-side-gap: clamp(82px, 7vw, 128px);     /* shared inset for both vertical rules (red left + blue right) */
    background-color:#f5dd4f !important;              /* pale legal-pad yellow */
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(90deg,
        transparent calc(100% - var(--ak-paper-side-gap)),
        rgba(44,120,180,.60) calc(100% - var(--ak-paper-side-gap)),
        rgba(44,120,180,.60) calc(100% - var(--ak-paper-side-gap) + 2px),
        transparent calc(100% - var(--ak-paper-side-gap) + 2px)),   /* blue RIGHT margin rule */
      linear-gradient(90deg,
        transparent var(--ak-paper-side-gap),
        rgba(218,40,50,.74) var(--ak-paper-side-gap),
        rgba(218,40,50,.74) calc(var(--ak-paper-side-gap) + 2px),
        transparent calc(var(--ak-paper-side-gap) + 2px)),          /* red LEFT margin rule */
      linear-gradient(180deg,
        #f5dd4f 0,
        #f5dd4f var(--ak-paper-top-gap),
        transparent var(--ak-paper-top-gap)),                       /* blank yellow TOP band */
      linear-gradient(180deg,
        transparent calc(100% - var(--ak-paper-bottom-gap)),
        #f5dd4f calc(100% - var(--ak-paper-bottom-gap) + 36px)),     /* blank yellow BOTTOM band */
      repeating-linear-gradient(180deg,
        transparent 0 31px,
        rgba(44,120,180,.60) 31px 32px) !important;                 /* blue horizontal ruled lines */
    background-repeat:no-repeat, no-repeat, no-repeat, no-repeat, repeat !important;
    background-position:0 0, 0 0, 0 0, 0 0, 0 var(--ak-paper-top-gap) !important;
    background-attachment:scroll, scroll, scroll, scroll, scroll !important;
  }

  /* ---- Transparency backstops — let the body paper show through the page
     chrome (without them the top reads as a black band, esp. on mobile).
     .gradient is scoped to #MainContent .gradient (NOT a bare .gradient) so it
     can never clobber the html.ak-mysterybox-page body paper paint. ---- */
  .ak-mysterybox-page #MainContent{ background:transparent !important; }
  .ak-mysterybox-page #MainContent .gradient{ background:transparent !important; background-image:none !important; }
  .ak-mysterybox-page .shopify-section{ background:transparent !important; }

  /* ---- THE ONE ROUTE-SPECIFIC PAINT: strip the embed wrapper's full-bleed
     #000 so the paper shows in the gutters around the centered dark monitor.
     `background` ONLY — height / min-height / width / margin-left / overflow /
     position / display / box-sizing / the JS-set inline embed.style.height and
     EVERY child (.ak-mb-frame / .ak-mb-iframe / .ak-mb-stage / .ak-mb-lock /
     .ak-mb-canvas) are NOT touched. The monitor stays its dark device. ---- */
  .ak-mysterybox-page #ak-mysterybox-embed.ak-mb-wrap{ background:transparent !important; }

  /* ============================================================
     FONTS — Due Date display voice (duplicated scoped @font-face,
     the deliberate house pattern; same self-hosted asset as the
     other notebook pages). No Tenada: there is no '#' on this route.
     ============================================================ */
  @font-face{
    font-family: 'AK Due Date';
    src: url('{{ 'ak-due-date.woff2' | asset_url }}') format('woff2');
    font-weight: normal;
    font-style: normal;
    font-display: swap;
  }

  /* ============================================================
     HEADER / NAV / CART — FULL notebook parity, ported from the
     accepted mask-PNG nav treatment and re-scoped to .ak-mysterybox-page.
     ak-top.liquid is NOT edited. CANDYFACTS (.ak-top-candy, href
     /pages/mystery-box) is the active tile here: it is an IMAGE tile, so its
     active state is the base candy-img magenta glow (left intact), not the
     masked-wordmark ::before cue.
     ============================================================ */
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-wrap{ background:transparent !important; }
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-wrap::after{ background:none !important; }
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-label{ color:#15120b !important; }
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-bad{ color:#15120b !important; }
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-mobile-trigger{ color:#15120b !important; text-shadow:none !important; }
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-label::before,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-label::after{ opacity:0 !important; }
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-tile:hover .ak-top-label,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-tile.is-active .ak-top-label,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-bad:hover,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-bad.is-active,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-mobile-trigger:hover{ color:#ff33ff !important; }
  /* cart: black ink at rest, magenta glow on hover/focus; small right nudge so the blue right rule isn't crowded */
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-cart-container{ transform:translateX(clamp(4px, .6vw, 10px)) !important; }
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-cart-img{ filter:brightness(0) !important; }
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-cart-link:hover .ak-top-cart-img,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-cart-link:focus-visible .ak-top-cart-img{
    filter:brightness(0) drop-shadow(0 0 6px #ff33ff) drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(255,51,255,.5)) !important;
  }
  /* tighten logo->nav spacing + remove the dark-theme glow divider */
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-divider{ display:none !important; }
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-nav-panel{ padding-top:clamp(2px,0.6vw,8px) !important; }
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-nav-area{ margin-top:clamp(-22px,-2.2vw,-8px) !important; }
  /* per-tile mask + size + tilt (same PNGs / sizes / tilts as the accepted notebook nav) */
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-life{    --ak-nav-mask:url("https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0930/3267/7656/files/lifestyle_button.png?v=1780886497"); --ak-nav-png-size:clamp(260px, 21vw, 400px);   --ak-nav-tilt:-2.2deg; }
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-products{--ak-nav-mask:url("https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0930/3267/7656/files/products_button.png?v=1780886497");  --ak-nav-png-size:clamp(280px, 23vw, 430px);   --ak-nav-tilt:1.4deg; }
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-archive{ --ak-nav-mask:url("https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0930/3267/7656/files/archive_button.png?v=1780885375");   --ak-nav-png-size:clamp(270px, 22vw, 420px);   --ak-nav-tilt:-1.1deg; }
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-narrative{--ak-nav-mask:url("https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0930/3267/7656/files/narrative_button.png?v=1780885375"); --ak-nav-png-size:clamp(265px, 21.5vw, 410px); --ak-nav-tilt:1.8deg; }
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-contact{ --ak-nav-mask:url("https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0930/3267/7656/files/moniker_button.png?v=1780885375");   --ak-nav-png-size:clamp(220px, 18vw, 340px);   --ak-nav-tilt:-1.6deg; }
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-bad{ --ak-nav-tilt:-2.5deg; }
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-candy{ --ak-nav-tilt:1.2deg; }
  /* clickable tiles (all 7): no transform / bg-png / recolor-filter; transform excluded from transitions */
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-life,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-products,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-archive,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-narrative,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-contact,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-bad,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-candy{
    transform:none !important; -webkit-transform:none !important;
    background-image:none !important; filter:none !important;
    transition-property:filter, color, opacity, background-color !important;
    will-change:auto !important;
  }
  /* the five wordmark masks live on ::before (holds the static tilt; overrides base .ak-top-tile::before{display:none}) */
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-life::before,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-products::before,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-archive::before,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-narrative::before,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-contact::before{
    content:"" !important; display:block !important; position:absolute !important;
    left:50% !important; top:50% !important;
    width:var(--ak-nav-png-size) !important; height:var(--ak-nav-png-size) !important;
    transform:translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(var(--ak-nav-tilt)) translateZ(0) !important;
    -webkit-transform:translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(var(--ak-nav-tilt)) translateZ(0) !important;
    transform-origin:center center !important;
    backface-visibility:hidden !important; -webkit-backface-visibility:hidden !important;
    pointer-events:none !important;
    background-color:#15120b !important;
    -webkit-mask:var(--ak-nav-mask) center / contain no-repeat !important;
    mask:var(--ak-nav-mask) center / contain no-repeat !important;
    transition:background-color .12s ease, opacity .12s ease !important;
    z-index:1 !important;
  }
  /* hover / keyboard-focus / press -> the WHOLE wordmark turns purple (.is-active EXCLUDED — it has its own rule) */
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-life:hover::before, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-life:focus-visible::before, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-life:active::before,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-products:hover::before, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-products:focus-visible::before, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-products:active::before,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-archive:hover::before, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-archive:focus-visible::before, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-archive:active::before,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-narrative:hover::before, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-narrative:focus-visible::before, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-narrative:active::before,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-contact:hover::before, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-contact:focus-visible::before, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-contact:active::before{
    background-color:#ff33ff !important;
  }
  /* ACTIVE wordmark cue — fires for an active MASKED tile (parity with
     Archive/Narrative). On /pages/mystery-box the active tile is CANDYFACTS
     (an IMAGE tile with no ::before mask), so this rule is inert here; the
     candy active glow comes from the base .ak-top-candy.is-active .ak-top-candy-img. */
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-tile.is-active::before{
    background-color:#ff33ff !important;
    filter:
      drop-shadow(0 0 4px #ff33ff)
      drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(255,51,255,.75))
      drop-shadow(0 0 24px rgba(255,51,255,.5)) !important;
  }
  /* keep the five labels in the DOM for screen readers, but visually hidden in ALL states */
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-life .ak-top-label, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-life:hover .ak-top-label, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-life:focus-visible .ak-top-label, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-life:active .ak-top-label, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-life.is-active .ak-top-label,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-products .ak-top-label, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-products:hover .ak-top-label, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-products:focus-visible .ak-top-label, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-products:active .ak-top-label, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-products.is-active .ak-top-label,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-archive .ak-top-label, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-archive:hover .ak-top-label, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-archive:focus-visible .ak-top-label, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-archive:active .ak-top-label, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-archive.is-active .ak-top-label,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-narrative .ak-top-label, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-narrative:hover .ak-top-label, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-narrative:focus-visible .ak-top-label, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-narrative:active .ak-top-label, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-narrative.is-active .ak-top-label,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-contact .ak-top-label, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-contact:hover .ak-top-label, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-contact:focus-visible .ak-top-label, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-contact:active .ak-top-label, .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-contact.is-active .ak-top-label{
    color:transparent !important; text-shadow:none !important;
  }
  /* BAD / CANDY: tilt+scale on the inner graphic, anchor stays transform-stable (sizes BAD 1.18, CANDY 1.75). The candy-img filter is NOT set here, so the base active magenta glow survives. */
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-bad-mask{
    transform:scale(1.18) rotate(var(--ak-nav-tilt)) translateZ(0) !important;
    -webkit-transform:scale(1.18) rotate(var(--ak-nav-tilt)) translateZ(0) !important;
  }
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-top-candy-img{
    transform:scale(1.75) rotate(var(--ak-nav-tilt)) translateZ(0) !important;
    -webkit-transform:scale(1.75) rotate(var(--ak-nav-tilt)) translateZ(0) !important;
  }

  /* ============================================================
     FOOTER INTEGRATION — paper shows behind the footer, ink
     back-to-top, Due Date CTA. ak-footer.liquid is NOT edited.
     ============================================================ */
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-footer{ background:transparent !important; }
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-btt{ color:#15120b !important; }                     /* .ak-btt-text inherits */
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-footer-copy{ color:rgba(21,18,11,.5) !important; }
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-btt:hover .ak-btt-text,
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-btt:focus-visible .ak-btt-text{ color:#ff33ff !important; } /* preserve purple hover/focus */
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-footer-rule{ background:none !important; }           /* remove footer glow line (keep spacing) */
  .ak-mysterybox-page .ak-btt-text{ font-family:'AK Due Date', Impact, Haettenschweiler, 'Arial Narrow Bold', sans-serif !important; }
</style>
